00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:35.322
No, that's okay!

00:13:35.405 --> 00:13:40.535
In Japan, when a male takes a bath,
the female takes care of him.

00:13:40.618 --> 00:13:42.454
It says so in your materials.

00:13:42.537 --> 00:13:44.164
S-Stop!

00:13:44.247 --> 00:13:47.167
Again, what material did you read that in?

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.252
What's all the racket?

00:13:50.503 --> 00:13:52.672
M-Manami, it's not what you think!

00:13:52.756 --> 00:13:56.051
Once again, you've implanted
false knowledge in her.

00:13:56.134 --> 00:13:58.511
If it's not one thing, it's another!

00:13:58.595 --> 00:14:01.806
This is the last straw!
Stay right where you are!

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:03.183
W-Wait!

00:14:03.266 --> 00:14:04.434
Help!

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:09.356
What's the matter?

00:14:09.439 --> 00:14:12.817
I-It's not like that!
This is a misunderstanding!

00:14:12.901 --> 00:14:15.111
Futaba, would you like to join us?

00:14:15.195 --> 00:14:17.155
Eris! This isn't right!

00:14:21.576 --> 00:14:23.161
Why, you...

00:14:23.244 --> 00:14:25.205
...sick perv!!

00:14:28.124 --> 00:14:29.459
"You okay?"

00:14:29.459 --> 00:14:31.044
"You okay?"
It wasn't my fault, right?

00:14:31.044 --> 00:14:31.753
It wasn't my fault, right?

00:14:31.836 --> 00:14:32.921
Good grief!

00:14:33.004 --> 00:14:35.256
What nerve he has!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.385
Futaba, just what do you see in that guy?

00:14:41.638 --> 00:14:43.556
You do like Kio, don't you?

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:50.647
Oh, um, well...
Kinjoh, don't you like Kakazu?

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:52.941
That idiot? You must be joking!

00:14:53.024 --> 00:14:55.151
But you two are so close.

00:14:55.235 --> 00:14:57.946
We've been stuck with
each other since we were little.

00:14:58.029 --> 00:15:01.241
| did come close
to liking him once, though.

00:15:01.324 --> 00:15:03.868
By any chance, did he turn you down?

00:15:05.078 --> 00:15:06.871
Of course not!

00:15:09.249 --> 00:15:11.501
Kio was shy back then, too.

00:15:11.584 --> 00:15:16.172
He was vulnerable around girls,
and was even nervous talking to me.

00:15:16.256 --> 00:15:18.258
At some point along the line, though,

00:15:18.341 --> 00:15:22.303
he became able to speak
to me like all the other boys did.

00:15:22.387 --> 00:15:26.599
I'm sure he stopped
thinking of me as being a girl.

00:15:26.683 --> 00:15:30.728
Once I realized that,
| didn't care about it anymore.

00:15:30.812 --> 00:15:31.855
| see.

00:15:31.938 --> 00:15:35.608
His attitude toward you is different, Futaba.

00:15:35.692 --> 00:15:40.655
Unlike me, he definitely
thinks of you as being a girl.

00:15:44.617 --> 00:15:45.076
"Yoo-hoo!"

00:15:45.493 --> 00:15:49.372
2100 hours. The cute objects
are changing the guard.

00:15:49.456 --> 00:15:53.460
Serial numbers changing from 17 to... 17?

00:15:53.543 --> 00:15:54.919
What's going on?

00:15:55.670 --> 00:16:00.508
Still, I'm not an ordinary girl, so...

00:16:00.592 --> 00:16:01.885
Watch.

00:16:01.968 --> 00:16:03.344
Apport.

00:16:05.597 --> 00:16:07.348
What was that? A magic trick?

00:16:07.432 --> 00:16:11.019
It's my special ability. I was born with it.

00:16:12.729 --> 00:16:17.942
I'm able to teleport objects
within a 50-meter radius to me.

00:16:18.026 --> 00:16:21.362
As a result of this strange power I have,

00:16:21.446 --> 00:16:23.573
| was abandoned by my family.

00:16:24.407 --> 00:16:27.952
| was then brought up
to work in the underworld,

00:16:28.036 --> 00:16:31.498
and I've stained my hands with
blood many times for the mission's sake.

00:16:32.665 --> 00:16:34.125
Futaba...

00:16:34.209 --> 00:16:38.588
I've been living in
a different world than Kakazu.

00:16:43.551 --> 00:16:45.428
What is it, you guys?

00:16:45.512 --> 00:16:46.971
An intruder!

00:16:47.347 --> 00:16:48.723
Apport!

00:16:51.559 --> 00:16:52.268
Cover me!

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:54.437
Huh? Hold on!

00:16:54.521 --> 00:16:55.897
Geez...

00:17:08.826 --> 00:17:11.788
If they have two of the
same kind, they won't miss one.

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.126
Apport!

00:17:23.091 --> 00:17:24.425
S-Sorry!

00:17:24.509 --> 00:17:25.552
You fool!

00:17:25.635 --> 00:17:28.721
What if something
had happened to the kitty?

00:17:28.805 --> 00:17:30.265
Don't move.

00:17:31.224 --> 00:17:33.935
State your affiliation and rank.

00:17:34.018 --> 00:17:37.105
CIA? Or is it the Immigration Bureau?

00:17:37.188 --> 00:17:40.984
Hmph, I won't have you
lumping us in with those lowlife scum.

00:17:41.985 --> 00:17:46.030
We are servants
of a much nobler master.

00:17:50.118 --> 00:17:51.202
A stun grenade!

00:17:51.286 --> 00:17:52.370
Oh, no!

00:17:52.453 --> 00:17:53.746
They got away!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.415
Are you all right?!

00:17:56.457 --> 00:17:57.792
Girls?!

00:17:57.875 --> 00:18:00.003
Manami! Futabal!

00:18:05.967 --> 00:18:07.927
Th-That's dangerous, Manami!

00:18:09.887 --> 00:18:11.014
Welcome back.

00:18:11.014 --> 00:18:11.472
"Walcome back"
Welcome back.

00:18:11.472 --> 00:18:11.806
<i>"Welcome back"</i>

00:18:11.889 --> 00:18:12.640
"Wsalcome back"
“I'm homos"

00:18:15.727 --> 00:18:17.687
Don't look at me!

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.693
"Worn out?"

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:27.363
What's with him? He really is an idiot!

00:18:27.447 --> 00:18:30.158
It really wasn't Kakazu's fault.

00:18:30.241 --> 00:18:32.535
It's not a question of
whether it's his fault or not.

00:18:32.619 --> 00:18:35.079
He's a boy, so he
should be more considerate.

00:18:35.163 --> 00:18:37.540
But it was a crisis situation,

00:18:37.624 --> 00:18:41.586
and Kakazu just came
because he was concerned.

00:18:44.213 --> 00:18:47.050
You really do like Kio.

00:18:47.133 --> 00:18:48.384
W-Well...

00:18:48.468 --> 00:18:51.471
Listen, he's kind of wishy-washy,

00:18:51.554 --> 00:18:53.473
so if you take that passive
attitude with him,

00:18:53.556 --> 00:18:57.352
that overbearing alien is
going to take him away, little by little.

00:18:59.812 --> 00:19:02.815
What other choice
is there but to back you up?

00:19:02.899 --> 00:19:05.234
Don't let that alien get the best of you.

00:19:05.318 --> 00:19:06.778
But I...

00:19:06.861 --> 00:19:10.698
If a woman doesn't mention her past,
she may as well not have one.

00:19:10.782 --> 00:19:12.825
Have a little more faith in yourself.

00:19:13.868 --> 00:19:16.079
Thank you, Kinjoh.

00:19:16.162 --> 00:19:20.333
Call me Manami. Is it okay if I call you Aoi?

00:19:20.416 --> 00:19:21.793
Mm-hmm.

00:19:28.091 --> 00:19:33.179
And so, they all spent the
night under one roof as they pleased.

00:19:34.472 --> 00:19:36.808
As it happens,
there's something I'd like to discuss.

00:19:36.891 --> 00:19:38.893
Would you all like to become employees

00:19:38.976 --> 00:19:40.812
of the provisional Catian Embassy?

00:19:40.895 --> 00:19:43.898
Us? Employees?

00:19:43.981 --> 00:19:46.943
It will be a great help to us to
have people who are familiar with Earth

00:19:47.026 --> 00:19:48.611
giving us a hand.

00:19:48.695 --> 00:19:52.615
Especially you two,
who appear to have some special abilities.

00:19:52.699 --> 00:19:55.618
| was wondering if you
might be our Security Police?

00:19:55.702 --> 00:19:56.828
Who, us?

00:19:56.911 --> 00:19:59.330
As S.P.? But...

00:20:03.376 --> 00:20:05.128
Hello, Manami.

00:20:05.211 --> 00:20:06.587
Jack!

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:08.798
What do you need?

00:20:08.881 --> 00:20:10.925
| just got some unusual intel.

00:20:12.218 --> 00:20:14.679
Manami, there seems to be an organization

00:20:14.762 --> 00:20:17.515
targeting your friend, the alien.

00:20:17.598 --> 00:20:19.350
Please be careful.

00:20:19.434 --> 00:20:23.479
Hold on, Jack! I interfered in your work!

00:20:23.563 --> 00:20:26.357
My job was just to take her away.

00:20:26.441 --> 00:20:28.901
Everything after that was not my responsibility.

00:20:29.986 --> 00:20:33.030
Manami, you took the wind
out of the sails of a guy I dislike,

00:20:33.114 --> 00:20:34.490
so I'm happy with you.

00:20:34.574 --> 00:20:36.659
In any case, please watch yourself.

00:20:36.743 --> 00:20:39.454
If I hear anything, I'll be in touch.

00:20:40.496 --> 00:20:41.414
Manami?

00:20:41.497 --> 00:20:42.915
What, Aoi?

00:20:42.999 --> 00:20:45.752
Do you think maybe
that we weren't the targets

00:20:45.835 --> 00:20:47.962
of those who came around?

00:20:49.005 --> 00:20:50.798
Who is this Jack person?

00:20:50.882 --> 00:20:53.885
That's the boyfriend
that Manami is going out with.

00:20:53.968 --> 00:20:57.013
She's not my boyfriend!
She's an honest-to-goodness woman!

00:20:57.096 --> 00:20:58.639
Huh? Is that right?

00:20:59.682 --> 00:21:03.936
Janice Allectus Carotinas
Kalinart, or "JACK" for short.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:07.482
She's my boss at the CIA,
though she's not a boss.

00:21:07.565 --> 00:21:11.861
Oh, she has a masculine name,
and whenever you get a call from her,

00:21:11.944 --> 00:21:13.321
you're always whispering,

00:21:13.404 --> 00:21:15.531
so I thought you were
secretly seeing each other.

00:21:15.615 --> 00:21:16.824
Now, look...

00:21:16.908 --> 00:21:21.454
So that's it. Manami,
you weren't really seeing anyone at all.

00:21:21.537 --> 00:21:23.956
Sorry to disappoint you, but I'm single.

00:21:26.209 --> 00:21:27.794
Say, Kio...

00:21:27.877 --> 00:21:29.045
What?

00:21:29.754 --> 00:21:31.881
Mm-mm, it's nothing.

00:21:31.964 --> 00:21:33.716
What is it? You're acting funny.

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:35.593
Nothing at all.

00:21:41.057 --> 00:21:43.476
I'm terribly sorry, ma'am.

00:21:43.559 --> 00:21:45.812
| was unable to bring you your gift.

00:21:48.856 --> 00:21:52.819
| will get it next time,
for sure. Along with the Divine Embodiment.

00:22:05.957 --> 00:22:09.126
You're there smiling next to me,

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:13.923
but it looks like that alone won't do it

00:22:14.006 --> 00:22:21.806
I wish I could touch you,
like a misty breeze

00:22:21.889 --> 00:22:29.814
My feelings can't get out
of the forest of my memories

00:22:29.897 --> 00:22:36.529
They just go to show the
never-changing distance between us

00:22:36.612 --> 00:22:45.997
Our future is held hostage by
waning and waxing irreconcilability

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:48.708
I have to break through

00:22:48.791 --> 00:22:53.170
Every time I think of you,

00:22:53.254 --> 00:22:56.674
the memories get in the way

00:22:56.757 --> 00:23:01.178
When I want to tenderly offer
you the side of me

00:23:01.262 --> 00:23:04.557
that no one else knows

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:20.990
I'll follow my heart, and come to see you

00:23:28.706 --> 00:23:30.333
The otaku pantheon, the magical girl chateau,

00:23:30.416 --> 00:23:32.335
the fanboy hangout, the collector's shelter,

00:23:32.418 --> 00:23:36.130
the Broadway of
carnal desires is the final enemy!

00:23:36.213 --> 00:23:38.674
Next time,
"We've Come to Kidnap You."

00:23:38.758 --> 00:23:42.303
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:47.433
"See you next time!"
